<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's EDP posting H1 results in Sept.</title>
<headline>Portugal's EDP posting H1 results in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-controlled utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal will only post its first half results in September, a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The company was partially privatised earlier this year.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
</text>
